 implies the printed one. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.lem-linear-channel-nogo"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.lem-linear-channel-nogo"],"id":"long.lem-linear-channel-nogo","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Lemma 6.47 (Linear functionals factoring through one value)","locator":"Long record Lemma 6.47, p. 57, label lem:linear-channel-nogo","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $V$ be a vector space over $\\mathbb Q$, let $\\mathrm{ev}:V\\to\\mathbb Q$ be linear, and choose $e\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{ev}(e)=1$. Suppose that each linear functional $\\ell_j:V\\to\\mathbb Q$ vanishes on $\\ker(\\mathrm{ev})$. Then $v-\\mathrm{ev}(v)e\\in\\ker(\\mathrm{ev})$ gives $\\ell_j(v)=\\ell_j(e)\\mathrm{ev}(v)$. Consequently any finite evaluation matrix $(\\ell_j(v_i))_{i,j}$ is an outer product and has rank at most one. Every square minor of order at least two therefore vanishes. This excludes determinant arguments formed from these particular functionals, not determinant methods with additional independent information.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.lem-linear-channel-nogo","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.lem-linear-channel-nogo","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.lem-linear-channel-nogo%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.AdelicHeightObstruction.linearDescender_eq_smul_eval%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.lem-linear-channel-nogo%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.AdelicHeightObstruction.linearDescender_eq_smul_eval%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.AdelicHeightObstruction.linearDescender_eq_smul_eval"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.lem-linear-channel-nogo","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.lem-linear-channel-nogo%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfTrappingReturnCarry.relationInvariantLinearChannels_det_eq_zero%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.lem-linear-channel-nogo%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfTrappingReturnCarry.relationInvariantLinearChannels_det_eq_zero%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.HalfTrappingReturnCarry.relationInvariantLinearChannels_det_eq_zero"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.lem-linear-channel-nogo%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.AdelicHeightObstruction.linearDescender_eq_smul_eval%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","id":"field:0ae78e4dcc4cff96a32a3be642717dbc92065fe12a70e74148d24d1a27cfb830","kind":"from","owner_ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.lem-linear-channel-nogo%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.AdelicHeightObstruction.linearDescender_eq_smul_eval%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"edge_endpoint_reference","source_field":"from","to":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.lem-linear-channel-nogo"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/evidence/mapping.long.lem-linear-channel-nogo","id":"field:1870275fcec41fbf0486e76f292e9316d53e0bda0cce7c870237e46b0fab0d84","kind":"subject_ids","owner_ref":"sh